<title>USA: Redwood Trust offering priced at $31.75.</title>
<headline>Redwood Trust offering priced at $31.75.</headline>
<dateline>MILL VALLEY, Calif. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Redwood Trust Inc said its public offering of 1.25 million shares of common stock had priced at $31.75 per share.</p>
<p>The offering was managed by Montgomery Securites and is scheduled to close on November 22, the company said.</p>
